Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 21:54:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ROADMAP: the whole frame, with interpolation controlled and
 selection made mechanical

The design has been assembled across a long conversation and needed one place
to live that is not scrollback. Five parts, three of them already measured:
ink (closed by 277 and 287), fact tape (279, scales 52x with the mind
constant), the relational mind (4,417 weights, 288's seven gates), the mind
tape (289b is deciding), and the conjecture loop (planned).

What the document adds beyond restating the parts:

Interpolation is made CONTROLLED by three rules, none of them a chosen
constant. It is licensed by measured smoothness - 289b produces the curve of
accuracy against neighbour distance, and blending is allowed only inside the
radius where accuracy still beats the floor, re-read as the memory grows.
It is gap-filling ONLY - a conjecture may be written where the fact tape is
silent and nowhere else, so it can never overwrite evidence and "the mind can
never be better than its tape" survives intact while "the mind may speak where
the tape does not" becomes possible. And depth discipline stands: only depth 0
is evidence, only text resets depth, so conjecture cannot compound.

Evolution is stated as mechanism rather than metaphor, with all three
ingredients mapped: variation is interpolated midpoints and new situations,
heredity is a pattern being reused when a similar situation recurs, selection
is incoming text confirming or refuting what a pattern produced. The crucial
clause: refutation costs the MECHANISM, not just the slot. And the environment
is real - the corpus stream is something the mind cannot edit, which is
precisely the property whose absence killed the judge-consistency reward.

The plan is 289b -> 289 (answers become derivations, G_answer_is_derivation
strictly stronger than G_answer_is_slot) -> 290 (conjecture writing) -> 291
(selection) -> 292 (generation as structure plus pointers), each with a cost
and with the number that would kill it. Plus one cross-cutting fix: the
abstain reward is a picked constant and G_beats_silence has therefore never
meant anything; derived per example as the value of a uniform guess, 2/c - 1,
it starts meaning "beats guessing".

Section 6 names the four ways the concept fails, written before the runs
rather than after. The first is the real bet: the verb curve. If coverage
against installed verbs climbs linearly instead of saturating, the useful part
of thinking is not finitely axiomatizable in this vocabulary and the project
has rebuilt a network with facts in it. That plot starts at 289 and is cheap.

